3:["$","section","Direct sound as a separate layer",{"id":"s3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Direct sound as a separate layer"}],[["$","p","List ambience, synchronized effects, dialogue and music separately. If speech matters, keep the line short and define speaker, tone and environment.",{"children":"List ambience, synchronized effects, dialogue and music separately. If speech matters, keep the line short and define speaker, tone and environment."}],["$","p","Review visual and audio continuity independently. Native audio can sound convincing while containing incorrect words or effects, so final editing remains essential.",{"children":"Review visual and audio continuity independently. Native audio can sound convincing while containing incorrect words or effects, so final editing remains essential."}]]]}]
